    "title": "Easter plans? See what’s open and closed in Fort Collins",
    "text": "LIFEWhat's open and closed on Easter in Fort Collins Abigail Flores-JohnsonFort Collins ColoradoanApril 4, 2026, 5:02 a.m. MTEaster falls on April 5 this year, a Christian holiday observed by many communities that commemorates the resurrection of Jesus Christ.Often marked by family gatherings and colorful Easter egg hunts, the day also means some grocery stores, retailers and restaurants will close in observance, while others will stay open for last-minute errands or holiday plans. If you’re missing a final ingredient or planning an outing, this guide has you covered.",
